OL,5,G2200 Major Crimes Unit                 
OL,6,     FIn Dudley, after gunfire rips     
OL,7,     Fthrough a young mother's front    
OL,8,     Fdoor and a shot strikes her in the
OL,9,     Fhip, the team are tasked with     
OL,10,     Fidentifying the perpetrators,     
OL,11,     Fleaving no stone unturned.        
OL,12,G2330 Forensics: Murder Scene           
OL,13,     FOn New Year's Eve in Swansea, a   
OL,14,     Fmass brawl leaves a teenage boy   
OL,15,     Ffighting for his life, prompting  
OL,16,     Fdetectives to piece together CCTV 
OL,17,     Fand social media evidence to find 
OL,18,     Fthose responsible.                
